    "detailed_description": "Immerse yourself in the darkness of an enigmatic apartment where every shadow hides a terrifying secret. Embark on a breathtaking quest to discover the truth behind a sinister presence that stalks you at every step.<br><br>In this immersive horror game, you play as Joel who wakes up with no memories in an unfamiliar apartment. As you explore the dark and dilapidated rooms, disturbing clues reveal traces of an ancient crime involving a mysteriously missing child. But be careful, you are not alone...<br><br>Use your ingenuity and courage to escape this omnipresent threat and solve the mystery that haunts these places. The line between reality and nightmare is blurring, and every decision you make can bring you closer to the truth or your end.<br><br>Do you dare to discover what the darkness hides?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045770/extras/7f2cfd88b1ec8caeaddafc9bd987d1fc.poster.avif?t=1723766447\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045770/extras/7f2cfd88b1ec8caeaddafc9bd987d1fc.webm?t=1723766447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>An oppressive atmosphere, immersive graphics and soundtrack will immerse you in a frightening atmosphere.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045770/extras/b6e38b7456c6270e757ad5bba6f46dbf.poster.avif?t=1723766447\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045770/extras/b6e38b7456c6270e757ad5bba6f46dbf.webm?t=1723766447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><u>Game duration: 45-60min</u>",
